  "gaps": [
    "The capture contains several programs (end of A.S. Cybersecurity, all of A.S. Information Technology, all of B.S. Accounting, and the start of B.S. Business Administration). The request did not say which one to use, so this ledger covers A.S. Information Technology, the first program captured in full. Confirm the intended program.",
    "The capture says 'Credit Hours' but does not explicitly state that they are semester hours. The semester system is assumed.",
    "The General Education course lists are captured only for Humanities and Fine Arts Groups A and B. The eligible courses for Social and Behavioral Sciences / History, Natural Sciences, Mathematics and English Composition are not in the capture.",
    "No residency or institutional-credit requirement (minimum credits that must be earned at the university) is stated in the capture.",
    "Open electives must take 'into consideration the degree program upper-level requirements', but those upper-level requirements are not stated in the capture.",
    "Minimum grade and GPA requirements for graduation are not stated in the capture."
